---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import catalogs from '../data/catalogs.json';
---
<Base title="Creative | TekNeek Services" current="/creative/"><section class="subhero"><p class="eyebrow">TEKNEEK CREATIVE</p><h1>Gifts worth making personal.</h1></section><section class="wrap"><p class="lede">Personalized engraved gifts, keepsakes, awards, and custom creations. Browse supplier catalogs for inspiration, then send TekNeek the item name or number and your personalization idea.</p><div class="notice"><strong>Browse for inspiration. Order through TekNeek.</strong> Availability, suitability for engraving, and pricing are confirmed when you request a quote.</div><h2>Browse personalized gift catalogs</h2><div class="catalogs">{catalogs.items.map(item=><a href={item.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>{item.title}</strong><span>{item.description}</span><small>Browse catalog ↗</small></a>)}</div><h2>Found something you like?</h2><p>Send the product name or item number, desired quantity, and your engraving idea. I'll confirm options and prepare a quote.</p><a class="btn dark" href="https://m.me/TekNeekServices" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ask About Personalization ↗</a></section></Base>